"Recon Sweep","Scouts feel out the other side\'s positions. The front doesn\'t move, but the winner has the edge in the next battle: initiative in its first round.","Probing Attack","Light forces test the defender\'s line. The attacker picks the moment, so it wins initiative a little more often.","Skirmish","Light units clash over the ground between the lines.","Pitched Battle","Both sides commit their main forces.","Decisive Engagement","Everything rides on this one. The front moves two steps either way, and the pay is higher.",
"Hold the Ridge","The defender is dug in on high ground with a garrison rifle platoon. If time runs out, the defender only has to be close.","Breakthrough","The attacker presses its last win. It wins initiative more often, and the enemy\'s force limit shifts 15% in the attacker\'s favor. A win moves the front two steps.","Counterattack","The defender strikes back while the attacker is off balance, winning initiative more often. A defender win moves the front two steps.","Supply Raid","Raiders hit the defender\'s supply lines. If time runs out, the attacker only has to be close.",
"Night Raid","A strike under cover of darkness. The attacker wins initiative more often.","River Crossing","The defender holds a river line. It wins initiative a little more often, and if time runs out it only has to be close.","Lance Clash","Mech against mech, nothing else on the field.","Armored Thrust","Tanks, cars and infantry, no mechs. The enemy\'s force limit shifts 10% in the attacker\'s favor.","Air Assault","The attacker leaps ahead by air. It wins initiative more often.","Street Fight","A fight for a town. The defender has two garrison squads, and if time runs out it only has to be close.",
"Siege Lines","The defender\'s outer works, covered by a gun emplacement.","Hold the Landing Zone","Backed up against its dropships, the attacker digs in with a garrison rifle platoon. If time runs out, the attacker only has to be close.","Storm Front","A thunderstorm grounds the VTOLs. Everything else fights.","Base Assault","The attacker reaches the defender\'s base: two garrison squads, an armored car, a gun emplacement and a laser turret stand with the defender. If the attacker wins, the planet falls. If not, it is thrown back a step.",
"Evacuation","The attacker is pushed back to its dropships. If the defender wins, the attacker leaves the planet. If the attacker holds (and if time runs out it only has to be close), reinforcements land and it can try again from the landing zone.","The value is too big for long type","The value is too big for long type: ","+5% to hit and 1 less heat","+10% damage","25% lighter","+5% to hit","+1 damage","+2 damage","+50% ammunition per bin, 10% cheaper","+25% damage on side and rear hits","Sunlance","A prototype heavy laser with a focusing array: long reach, high accuracy, a lot of heat.",
